---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import MainCard from "@/components/MainCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <MainCard
    title="雨霖铃慢"
    description="我的故事仍等待被述说..."
    textOverlay="关于"
    image="/favicon.svg"
    infoIcon="lucide:user"
  >
    <div class="space-y-10 mb-8">
      <!-- Profile Section -->
      <section class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center md:items-start">
        <div class="avatar">
          <div
            class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-xl ring ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2 overflow-hidden"
          >
            <img src="https://github.com/linglilongyi.png" alt="龙一" width="160" height="160" loading="eager" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 text-center md:text-left">
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">龙一</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-base-content/80 mb-4">充满好奇心的冲浪高手🏄‍♂️</p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center md:justify-start mb-6">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/linglilongyi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-sm btn-outline gap-2"
            >
              <Icon name="lucide:github" class="w-4 h-4" />
              <span>GitHub</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base-content/80">
            这里是绫里龙一，通称龙一，也有一个🥕会叫我🌵。<br/>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Tech Stack -->
      <section>
        <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6 overflow-x-auto">
          <p class="text-base-content/80">
            博客基于 <a href=https://github.com/EveSunMaple/Frosti>Astro-Frosti<a> 构建，源码托管在 <a href=https://github.com/linglilongyi/myblog>GitHub</a>。<br/>
            这是一个“全栈”博客，不仅有生活和技术，什么内容都有可能有。毕竟作者本人就是什么都会想会做会叭叭。<br/>
            我们做人已经抗下那么多标签了，网络冲浪又何必给自己那么多枷锁呢。<br/>
            所以基本上很难也基本没想过面对特定读者来写作，但也真心希望或多或少能给读者带来知识或者温暖。<br/>
          </p>

        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </MainCard>
</BaseLayout>
